<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--East Hartford, Conn., $9.08 million general obligation bonds.  </p>
<p>--Seymour, Conn. $11.785 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Grinnell-Newburg School District, Iowa, $4.990 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Lawton Bronson School District, Iowa, $5 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Athol, Mass., $3.3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Sag Harbor Union Free School District, N.Y., $3 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
